    {
      "text": "heavens cannot be numbered to man, but are numbered to God, Moses 1:37. heavens and earth pass away, another shall come, Moses 1:38. creation of heaven and earth revealed to Moses, Moses 2–3. firmament called Heaven, Moses 2:8. heavens were veiled, Moses 7:56. heavens shall be darkened, Moses 7:61 (JS—M 1:36). God dwells in heaven, Abr. 2:7. the Gods called expanse, Heaven, Abr. 4:8. the Gods finished heavens and earth, Abr. 5:1–4. stars shall fall from heaven, JS—M 1:33 (Matt. 24:29). powers of heaven shall be shaken, JS—M 1:33, 36 (Matt. 24:29). signs of the Son shall appear in heaven, JS—M 1:36 (Matt. 24:30). the Son will come in clouds of heaven, JS—M 1:36 (Matt. 24:30).",
